    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n64294" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λυχν-ίτης</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a precious stone of a red
				colour</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Erx.</u>
				400d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
