        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. λίθος</span> a name for Parian marble,
			which was quarried by lamplight, Varro ap.<i><span class="en">
				Plin.
